---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { loadCatalog } from '../lib/catalog/load';
import { sitePath } from '../lib/site-path';

const { domains, capabilities, knowledgeTopics, capabilityRelations } = await loadCatalog();
---

<BaseLayout title="游戏知识与能力地图">
  <section class="home-hero page-shell">
    <div class="home-hero__statement">
      <p class="plain-label">游戏知识与能力导航</p>
      <h1>先看见全貌，再决定下一步。</h1>
      <p class="lede">Learn About Games 把分散的知识、能力与资源放回一张可以讨论和修订的地图。</p>
      <p class="reference-note">参考不是标准。地图帮助你提问，不替你定义唯一道路。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="journey-index" aria-label="三个入口">
      <a href={sitePath('map/')} aria-labelledby="home-map-action" aria-describedby="home-map-description">
        <span id="home-map-action">看全貌</span>
        <p id="home-map-description">从 {domains.length} 个领域认识游戏设计及相邻知识的整体轮廓。</p>
      </a>
      <a href={sitePath('careers/')} aria-labelledby="home-careers-action" aria-describedby="home-careers-description">
        <span id="home-careers-action">职业方向</span>
        <p id="home-careers-description">用 AAA · Game Designer 参考画像理解一种生产语境。它不作个人评分，也不提供唯一答案。</p>
      </a>
      <a href={sitePath('resources/')} aria-labelledby="home-resources-action" aria-describedby="home-resources-description">
        <span id="home-resources-action">成长资源</span>
        <p id="home-resources-description">按主题和能力寻找可以进一步阅读、观看或练习的具体内容。</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-map-preview page-shell" aria-labelledby="home-map-title">
    <div>
      <h2 id="home-map-title">一张仍在生长的地图</h2>
      <p>当前公开 {domains.length} 个领域、{capabilities.length} 个能力与 {knowledgeTopics.length} 个知识议题，并用 {capabilityRelations.length} 条有明确含义的关系连接全图。</p>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href={sitePath('map/')}>打开能力地图</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
